OL,5,G0930 How Did We Get Here: No World
OL,6,G     Order
OL,7,     F6/6. Tristan Redman and guests
OL,8,     Fdiscuss the chaotic US withdrawal
OL,9,     Ffrom Afghanistan, Russia's
OL,10,     Ffull-scale invasion of Ukraine and
OL,11,     Fthe US capture of Venezuelan
OL,12,     FPresident Maduro.
OL,13,G1000 Woman's Hour
OL,14,     FWe celebrate the many different
OL,15,     Fways water shapes women's lives.
OL,16,G1100 All Kinds of Minds
OL,17,     F2/4. Nathan Filer explores what
OL,18,     Fhappens when neurodivergent
OL,19,     Fchildren struggle at school - and
OL,20,     Fasks how education can better
OL,21,     Frecognise distress, difference and
OL,22,     Fneed.
